{
    "title": "Ultimate 8 Ball Pool",
    "description": "<b>PLAY EPIC HEAD-TO-HEAD 8-BALL POOL GAMES AND ENJOY THE THRILL OF FULL 3D GRAPHICS AND PINPOINT ACCURATE PHYSICS</b>\r\n\r\nLooking for an incredible 8 Ball Pool experience? Look no further! Play against live opponents from around the world and become the King of Pool in the best full 3D 8 Ball Pool game! Compete in live multiplayer matches or play solo in hundreds of unique billiards challenges.\r\n\r\nSome of the features of Ultimate 8 Ball Pool include: \r\n\r\n<b>FULL 3D GRAPHICS:</b>\r\nPlay pool in FULL 3D with stunning photorealistic graphics. You can visualize every shot from any angle and even TAP-TO-ZOOM on your target and combo balls for pinpoint-accurate alignment. But if you prefer a traditional TOP-DOWN view, don't worry! That's still available and easy to use, too.\r\n\r\n<b>MULTIPLAYER HEAD-TO-HEAD BATTLES:</b>\r\nCompete against players from around the world in 1-on-1 matches and battle to the top of 2 unique Tour Modes. Compete on the 8 BALL TOUR, where you and your opponent will be matched up in a classic game of 8 Ball Pool. Or test your skills on the FAST BREAK TOUR, where you'll play Ultimate 8 Ball Pool's fast-paced take on competitive billiards. Clear the table in as few shots as possible, and play at the same time as your opponent, with no time wasted waiting for them to make their moves!\r\n\r\n<b>MULTIPLAYER POOL TOURNAMENTS:</b>\r\nCompete at your own pace in a variety of DAILY TOURNAMENT CHALLENGES! Post your best score to the leaderboard and return later to collect your rewards. And, if your real life gets in the way, you can pause the game and resume when you are ready to play some more. \r\n\r\n<b>INTRODUCING POOL ROYALE:</b>\r\nStand above the rest and play an action-packed POOL ROYALE, where you compete against dozens of live opponents simultaneously in a timed multi-round event designed to test your skills under pressure. \r\n\r\n<b>REALISTIC PHYSICS FOR AN AUTHENTIC EXPERIENCE:</b>\r\nYou won't find a more authentic 8 Ball Pool experience than this! Become a trickshot master and learn to execute perfect curve, masse, and jump shots to help you score in any situation. If a shot is possible in real life, it's possible in Ultimate 8 Ball Pool!\r\n\r\n<b>MASTER 8 BALL TRICKSHOT CHALLENGES:</b>\r\nProve that you can dominate any pool table by solving hundreds of unique BILLIARD PUZZLES while earning prizes along the way. \r\n\r\n<b>COLLECT GEAR AND UNLOCK POOL TABLES:</b>\r\nCustomize your game and boost your performance with a massive collection of CUE STICKS, CUE BALLS, POOL TABLES, POWER UPS, and more. Mix and match gear to your heart's content... and at the expense of your opponent's ego.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? Play Ultimate 8 Ball Pool game in full 3D and entirely for FREE\u2026 today! \r\n\r\nNeed a little help? We are here to assist you: support@hypgames.com",
